  "description": "*“Stop whining, it’s annoying.”*\n\nThe sudden change and betrayal of her husband, who had been a son-in-law by marriage. Artia, slowly wearing down in the duke’s mansion where she had no allies, threw herself into the lake, and the moment she opened her eyes again, she was transformed into a different person. Having finally shaken up high society and succeeded in a miraculous divorce, Artia begins to casually look for a second husband at the insistence of the family elders…\n\n*“After going through such a difficult divorce, why are you already looking for a husband?”*\n\nFor some reason, the Second Prince Kilian, famous as the “Mad Prince\", keeps hovering around her!\n\nWill Artia be able to welcome her second husband safely?\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
